              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kolomut do imalaikan ikanykaarei luejaas aiticaneta akanykaarei kotoma oyekalu, konapito ebaputa loelai loimilia, koenito atorobosiokec amunyin nuka esabu, ",
